                                <div class="o_byp_sp" style="--sp: 50px; --sp-md: 0px;"/>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-md-4">
                                <h2>Smart</h2>
                                <div class="o_byp_sp" style="--sp: 15px; --sp-xl: 24px;"/>
                                <p>By choosing smartly and rolling up your sleeves, you get more out of your party budget.</p>
                            </div>
