                <!-- Het verhaal: ontstaan vanuit Creact. De knop staat op
                     desktop rechtsboven en op mobiel onderaan, zoals bij B&B. -->
                <section class="o_byp_bg_beige">
                    <div class="o_byp_sp" style="--sp: 50px; --sp-md: 70px; --sp-xl: 100px;"/>
                    <div class="o_byp_grid">
                        <div class="row g-0">
                            <div class="col-md-6">
                                <h2 class="o_byp_title_narrow">Built on experience</h2>
                                <div class="o_byp_sp" style="--sp: 15px; --sp-xl: 27px;"/>
                                <p>Born from Creact</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-md-6 text-md-end d-none d-md-block">
                                <div class="o_byp_sp" style="--sp: 10px;"/>
                                <a class="o_byp_btn" href="https://creact.be" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Go to Creact</a>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="o_byp_sp" style="--sp: 50px; --sp-md: 80px; --sp-xl: 165px;"/>
                    <div class="o_byp_grid">
                        <div class="row g-0 o_byp_cols o_byp_offset_cols">
                            <div class="col-md-6">
                                <p>With years of experience in events, Jarne saw how much time and budget is often lost to needless arranging. Build Your Party makes that simpler.</p>
                                <div class="o_byp_sp" style="--sp: 30px; --sp-md: 0px;"/>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-md-6">
                                <p>Build Your Party grew out of the knowledge and experience of Creact. For larger or more complex events, Creact remains the partner for custom work.</p>
                                <div class="d-md-none">
                                    <div class="o_byp_sp" style="--sp: 50px;"/>
